 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Their claim «والله أمرنا بها» (28:8-10) is glossed with As-Sa'di's «وكذبوا في هذا». No motif in 28 and none on the devils. A lamp for «عند كل مسجد», growth for «كما بدأكم تعودون», two paths for the two parties. STAGING v4: c1 (28): three deniers in a town at dusk, gathered and talking among themselves (no speech toward an empty side, which could stand for the Prophet); the camera is on them on 28:4 (they excuse their deed by their fathers and claim a command, framed by As-Sa'di's gloss that they lied); a geometric plate on 28:12-16 (Allah does not command immorality); the camera holds on them from 28:15 to the end of the rebuke and never pans to an empty side. Nothing of the deed itself is drawn: no circling, no House, no uncovering. c2 (29-30): the command is shown through the believers, not the addressed mushrikin: on the left they pray (29:5), bow, prostrate on 29:9 (place of prostration, Muyassar: in every place of worship) and sit; a lamp plate, then growth for 29:14-16 (as He began you, you return; the return itself is not pictured). On 30:1 (a party He guided) they rise and a soft sparkle falls on them; on 30:3 (a party deserved error) three deniers enter on the right, shake their heads and turn away on 30:8 (they took the devils as allies, who are not drawn); the camera stays on them to the end. Nobody prostrates toward people: the right side is empty until 30:3."
 },
